  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The energy of akasha courses through your mind, increasing your mental capacity.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Con 13 or veilweaver level 1, a power point reserve.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can bind essence into this feat. You gain bonus power points equal to twice the bound essence. If you have the ability to bind a veil to your Head slot (even if you don’t have one currently bound), you gain an additional 2 bonus power points as long as at least 1 point of essence is bound in this feat.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
